  "reviewer_notes": "Single empirical application: linear energy baseline model fitted to per-minute data of a cracked gas compressor unit of an ethylene plant. The B-spline and general model forms are methodological proposals not empirically applied to the case; recorded as an adaptation (D2). EnPI is a flow ratio (turbine inlet steam flow over K-13005 product flow) interpreted as specific energy consumption. The post-APC comparison serves to quantify energy savings, not to validate model accuracy out-of-sample.",
